{"sections": [{"title": "", "blocks": [{"type": "html", "html": "<p>Sources: <a href=\"https://strudel.cc/learn/effects/\" rel=\"noopener\">https://strudel.cc/learn/effects/</a> (effects, envelopes, filters, panning, reverb, delay, distortion, duck), <a href=\"https://strudel.cc/learn/synths/\" rel=\"noopener\">https://strudel.cc/learn/synths/</a> (oscillators, noise, FM), <a href=\"https://strudel.cc/learn/signals/\" rel=\"noopener\">https://strudel.cc/learn/signals/</a> (signals), <a href=\"https://strudel.cc/learn/visual-feedback/\" rel=\"noopener\">https://strudel.cc/learn/visual-feedback/</a> (draw), <a href=\"https://strudel.cc/technical-manual/project-start/\" rel=\"noopener\">https://strudel.cc/technical-manual/project-start/</a> (packages). Ranges are as the docs state them; blank means the docs give none. Aliases in parentheses.</p>"}]}, {"title": "Effects and parameters", "blocks": [{"type": "table", "columns": ["Function (aliases)", "Parameter(s)", "What it does", "Documented range / default", "Source"], "rows": [["<code>lpf</code> (<code>cutoff</code>, <code>ctf</code>, <code>lp</code>)", "frequency", "Low-pass filter", "0 to 20000 Hz", "effects"], ["<code>lpq</code> (<code>resonance</code>)", "q", "Low-pass resonance", "0 to 50", "effects"], ["<code>hpf</code> (<code>hp</code>, <code>hcutoff</code>)", "frequency", "High-pass filter", "0 to 20000 Hz", "effects"], ["<code>hpq</code> (<code>hresonance</code>)", "q", "High-pass resonance", "0 to 50", "effects"], ["<code>bpf</code> (<code>bandf</code>, <code>bp</code>)", "frequency", "Band-pass center", "Hz", "effects"], ["<code>bpq</code> (<code>bandq</code>)", "q", "Band-pass Q", "", "effects"], ["<code>ftype</code>", "type", "Filter slope", "0=12db, 1=ladder, 2=24db", "effects"], ["<code>vowel</code>", "vowel", "Formant filter", "a, e, i, o, u, ae, aa, oe, ue, y, uh, un, en, an, on", "effects"], ["<code>tremolo</code> (<code>trem</code>)", "speed", "Amplitude LFO", "Hz", "effects"], ["<code>tremolosync</code> (<code>tremsync</code>)", "cycles", "Tremolo speed in cycles", "", "effects"], ["<code>tremolodepth</code> (<code>tremdepth</code>)", "depth", "Tremolo depth", "", "effects"], ["<code>tremoloskew</code> (<code>tremskew</code>)", "amount", "Tremolo skew", "0 to 1", "effects"], ["<code>tremolophase</code> (<code>tremphase</code>)", "offset", "Tremolo offset", "cycles", "effects"], ["<code>tremoloshape</code> (<code>tremshape</code>)", "shape", "LFO shape", "tri, square, sine, saw, ramp", "effects"], ["<code>attack</code> (<code>att</code>)", "seconds", "Amp attack", "seconds", "effects"], ["<code>decay</code> (<code>dec</code>)", "seconds", "Amp decay", "seconds", "effects"], ["<code>sustain</code> (<code>sus</code>)", "gain", "Amp sustain level", "0 to 1", "effects"], ["<code>release</code> (<code>rel</code>)", "seconds", "Amp release", "seconds", "effects"], ["<code>adsr</code>", "a:d:s:r", "Shorthand envelope", "seconds, sustain 0 to 1", "effects"], ["<code>lpattack</code> (<code>lpa</code>)", "seconds", "Filter envelope attack", "", "effects"], ["<code>lpdecay</code> (<code>lpd</code>)", "seconds", "Filter envelope decay", "", "effects"], ["<code>lpsustain</code> (<code>lps</code>)", "amplitude", "Filter envelope sustain", "", "effects"], ["<code>lprelease</code> (<code>lpr</code>)", "seconds", "Filter envelope release", "", "effects"], ["<code>lpenv</code> (<code>lpe</code>)", "depth", "Filter envelope depth", "0 to n", "effects"], ["<code>hpattack</code>/<code>hpa</code>, <code>bpattack</code>/<code>bpa</code> etc.", "", "Same pattern for hp and bp", "", "effects (listed, no separate section)"], ["<code>pattack</code> (<code>patt</code>)", "seconds", "Pitch envelope attack", "", "effects"], ["<code>pdecay</code> (<code>pdec</code>)", "seconds", "Pitch envelope decay", "", "effects"], ["<code>prelease</code> (<code>prel</code>)", "seconds", "Pitch envelope release", "", "effects"], ["<code>penv</code>", "semitones", "Pitch envelope depth; negative flips", "", "effects"], ["<code>pcurve</code>", "type", "Envelope curve", "0 linear, 1 exponential", "effects"], ["<code>panchor</code>", "anchor", "Pitch envelope anchor", "0 and 1 give different ranges; defaults to psustain", "effects"], ["<code>gain</code>", "amount", "Gain, exponential", "", "effects"], ["<code>velocity</code> (<code>vel</code>)", "", "Velocity, multiplied with gain", "0 to 1", "effects"], ["<code>compressor</code>", "threshold:ratio:knee:attack:release", "Dynamics", "", "effects"], ["<code>postgain</code>", "gain", "Gain after effects", "", "effects"], ["<code>xfade</code>", "", "Cross-fade L/R", "0 to 1", "effects"], ["<code>pan</code>", "position", "Stereo position", "0 (left) to 1 (right)", "effects"], ["<code>jux</code>", "function", "Apply function to right channel only", "", "effects"], ["<code>juxBy</code> (<code>juxby</code>)", "width", "Stereo width", "0 mono, 1 full", "effects"], ["<code>coarse</code>", "factor", "Sample-rate reduction", "1 = original, 2 = half, 3 = third...", "effects"], ["<code>crush</code>", "depth", "Bit crush", "1 to 16", "effects"], ["<code>distort</code> (<code>dist</code>)", "distortion, volume, type", "Waveshaper", "no range stated", "effects"], ["<code>orbit</code> (<code>o</code>)", "number", "Effect bus / routing group", "no range stated", "effects"], ["<code>delay</code>", "level", "Delay send", "0 to 1", "effects"], ["<code>delaytime</code> (<code>delayt</code>, <code>dt</code>)", "seconds", "Delay time", "seconds", "effects"], ["<code>delayfeedback</code> (<code>delayfb</code>, <code>dfb</code>)", "feedback", "Delay feedback", "0 to 1", "effects"], ["<code>room</code>", "level", "Reverb send; size via <code>:</code> in mini-notation", "", "effects"], ["<code>roomsize</code> (<code>rsize</code>, <code>sz</code>, <code>size</code>)", "size", "Reverb size", "0 to 10", "effects"], ["<code>roomfade</code> (<code>rfade</code>)", "seconds", "Reverb fade time", "seconds", "effects"], ["<code>roomlp</code> (<code>rlp</code>)", "frequency", "Reverb low-pass", "0 to 20000 Hz", "effects"], ["<code>roomdim</code> (<code>rdim</code>)", "frequency", "Reverb high-damp", "0 to 20000 Hz", "effects"], ["<code>iresponse</code> (<code>ir</code>)", "sample", "Impulse response sample", "", "effects"], ["<code>phaser</code> (<code>ph</code>)", "speed", "Phaser modulation speed", "", "effects"], ["<code>phaserdepth</code> (<code>phd</code>, <code>phasdp</code>)", "depth", "Phaser depth", "0 to 1; default 0.75", "effects"], ["<code>phasercenter</code> (<code>phc</code>)", "frequency", "Phaser center", "Hz; default 1000", "effects"], ["<code>phasersweep</code> (<code>phs</code>)", "sweep", "Phaser sweep", "0 to 4000 useful; default 2000", "effects"], ["<code>duckorbit</code> (<code>duck</code>)", "orbit", "Orbit to duck", "", "effects"], ["<code>duckattack</code> (<code>duckatt</code>, <code>datt</code>)", "seconds", "Duck recovery", "seconds", "effects"], ["<code>duckdepth</code>", "depth", "Duck depth", "0 to 1", "effects"], ["<code>fm</code>", "index", "FM modulation index", "no range", "synths"], ["<code>fmh</code>", "ratio", "FM harmonicity", "", "synths"], ["<code>fmattack</code>, <code>fmdecay</code>, <code>fmsustain</code>, <code>fmenv</code>", "", "FM envelope; <code>fmenv</code> is <code>lin</code> or <code>exp</code>; suffix 1 to 8 targets FM operator", "", "synths"], ["<code>vib</code>", "Hz:depth", "Vibrato, depth via <code>:</code>", "", "synths"], ["<code>vibmod</code>", "semitones", "Vibrato depth", "", "synths"], ["<code>tremolo</code> (ZZFX)", "0 to 1", "ZZFX tremolo", "", "synths"], ["<code>zcrush</code>", "0 to 1", "ZZFX crush", "", "synths"], ["<code>clip</code>", "", "Clamp values, e.g. <code>clip(saw.slow(2))</code>", "", "signals"]]}, {"type": "html", "html": "<p>Not documented on the fetched pages: <code>ply</code>, <code>off</code>, <code>every</code>, <code>palindrome</code>, <code>rev</code> (rev is used in a <code>jux</code> example only), <code>legato</code>, <code>speed</code> (used in a random-modifier example, no range). Treat as <strong>UNVERIFIED</strong>.</p>"}]}, {"title": "Oscillators and sound sources", "blocks": [{"type": "table", "columns": ["Name", "Type", "Notes", "Source"], "rows": [["<code>sine</code>, <code>sawtooth</code> (<code>saw</code>), <code>square</code>, <code>triangle</code>", "Basic oscillators", "Triangle is default for <code>note</code> without <code>sound</code>", "synths"], ["<code>white</code>, <code>pink</code>, <code>brown</code>, <code>crackle</code>", "Noise", "<code>crackle</code> uses <code>density</code>, no range given", "synths"], ["<code>user</code>", "Custom wave", "<code>partials</code> or <code>phases</code>; no range", "synths"], ["<code>wt_*</code> (e.g. <code>wt_flute</code>)", "Wavetable", "AKWF set, 1000+", "synths"], ["<code>z_sawtooth</code>, <code>z_tan</code>, <code>z_noise</code>, <code>z_sine</code>, <code>z_square</code>", "ZZFX", "", "synths"], ["<code>supersaw</code>", "Detuned saw stack", "Used in <code>s(&quot;supersaw&quot;).lpf(...)</code> example", "effects"]]}]}, {"title": "Signals", "blocks": [{"type": "table", "columns": ["Name", "Output", "Source"], "rows": [["<code>sine</code>, <code>cosine</code>, <code>saw</code>, <code>tri</code>, <code>square</code>", "0 to 1", "signals"], ["<code>sine2</code>, <code>cosine2</code>, <code>saw2</code>, <code>tri2</code>, <code>square2</code>, <code>rand2</code>", "-1 to 1", "signals"], ["<code>rand</code>", "Continuous random 0 to 1", "signals"], ["<code>perlin</code>", "Perlin noise 0 to 1", "signals"], ["<code>irand(n)</code>", "Integers 0 to n-1 (n exclusive)", "signals"], ["<code>brand</code>", "Random 0 or 1", "signals"], ["<code>brandBy(p)</code>", "Random 0 or 1, p = chance of 1", "signals"], ["<code>time</code>", "Cycle time", "signals (no example)"], ["<code>signal(fn)</code>", "Custom function signal", "signals"], ["<code>mouseX</code>, <code>mouseY</code>", "Mouse position 0 to 1", "signals"]]}, {"type": "html", "html": "<p>Shaping: <code>.range(lo, hi)</code>, <code>.segment(n)</code>, <code>.slow(n)</code>, <code>.clip()</code>.</p>"}]}, {"title": "Modules and packages", "blocks": [{"type": "html", "html": "<p>Official package names come from <a href=\"https://strudel.cc/technical-manual/project-start/\" rel=\"noopener\">https://strudel.cc/technical-manual/project-start/</a> (npm <code>@strudel</code> scope). The Codeberg packages folder could not be read, so the other names are <strong>UNVERIFIED</strong>.</p>"}, {"type": "table", "columns": ["Package", "Role", "Status"], "rows": [["<code>@strudel/web</code>", "Initialize REPL-like code in your own page (<code>initStrudel()</code>, <code>hush()</code>)", "Verified; unpkg <code>@strudel/web@1.0.3</code>"], ["<code>@strudel/repl</code>", "Embeddable <code>&lt;strudel-editor&gt;</code>", "Verified; unpkg <code>@strudel/repl@1.0.2</code>"], ["<code>@strudel/embed</code>", "Embeddable <code>&lt;strudel-repl&gt;</code> iframe", "Verified; unpkg <code>@strudel/embed@latest</code>"], ["<code>@strudel/core</code>", "Pattern engine", "UNVERIFIED (name from brief)"], ["<code>mini</code>", "Mini-notation parser", "UNVERIFIED"], ["<code>tonal</code>", "Note, scale and chord functions", "UNVERIFIED"], ["<code>webaudio</code>", "Web Audio integration", "UNVERIFIED"], ["<code>superdough</code>", "Synth and sampler engine", "UNVERIFIED"], ["<code>soundfonts</code>", "General MIDI soundfonts", "UNVERIFIED (soundfont page 404&#x27;d)"], ["<code>midi</code>", "MIDI output", "UNVERIFIED (midi page 404&#x27;d)"], ["<code>osc</code>", "OSC output", "UNVERIFIED"], ["<code>csound</code>", "Csound integration", "UNVERIFIED"], ["<code>draw</code>", "Visual feedback (see below)", "Partially verified via visual-feedback page"]]}, {"type": "html", "html": "<p>Visual functions (<a href=\"https://strudel.cc/learn/visual-feedback/\" rel=\"noopener\">https://strudel.cc/learn/visual-feedback/</a>): <code>_pianoroll()</code>, <code>_punchcard()</code> (keeps later transforms; options cycles=4, playhead=0.5, vertical, labels, smear, fill, active, inactive, minMidi=10, maxMidi=90, autorange), <code>_spiral()</code> (stretch, size, thickness, inset=3, steady, playheadColor, fade=1, logSpiral), <code>_scope()</code> / <code>tscope</code> (align=1, color, thickness=3, scale=0.25, pos, trigger=0), <code>_pitchwheel()</code>, <code>_spectrum()</code> (thickness=3, speed=1, min=-80 dB, max=0 dB), <code>markcss</code>, <code>all()</code>. Prefix <code>_</code> renders inline in the code. Source: <a href=\"https://strudel.cc/learn/visual-feedback/\" rel=\"noopener\">https://strudel.cc/learn/visual-feedback/</a></p>"}]}, {"title": "Not verified", "blocks": [{"type": "html", "html": "<p>Midi, soundfont and visual-feedback pages were partly unavailable; the midi and soundfont pages returned 404. Package listings were not readable. <code>vowel</code> and <code>loopAt</code> ranges, and <code>juxBy</code>&#x27;s exact behavior, are as documented, not tested.</p>"}]}]}